### 3.10 Student signs off their Semester 4 scorecard
POST {{baseUrl}}/academic/performance/111422104001/semester/4/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 3.11 Student views their own academic scorecard (All Semesters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/academic/my-performance
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 3.12 Staff views student's Semester 4 scorecard
GET {{baseUrl}}/academic/students/111422104001/semester/4
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}


