### 4.1 HOD / Admin assigns Mentee batch to Mentor
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentoring/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{hodToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mentorId": "mentor1",
  "studentIds": ["111422104001"],
  "academicYear": "2024-2025",
  "semester": 4
}

### 4.2 Mentor views their assigned mentee roster
GET {{baseUrl}}/mentoring/mentees
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}

### 4.3 Student views Page A Mentoring Activity
GET {{baseUrl}}/mentoring/activity/111422104001/semester/4
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 4.4 Student updates Page A Mentoring Activity (Difficulties, Lab, Library, Communication)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/mentoring/activity/111422104001/semester/4
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fieldOfInterest": "Full-Stack Distributed Systems and Cloud Architecture",
