### 4.10 4-Tier Leadership Sign-off Chain (Page D)
### Step 1: Mentor Sign-off
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentoring/review/111422104001/semester/4/sign-off
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}

### Step 2: Class Coordinator Sign-off
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentoring/review/111422104001/semester/4/sign-off
Authorization: Bearer {{coordToken}}

### Step 3: HOD Sign-off
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentoring/review/111422104001/semester/4/sign-off
Authorization: Bearer {{hodToken}}

### Step 4: Principal Sign-off
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentoring/review/111422104001/semester/4/sign-off
Authorization: Bearer {{principalToken}}


